  "summary": "FRC owns Force powers, the Force Point transaction model (ForcePointsService decisions, ActorEngine receipts/settlement per FP-RD rulings), Dark Side Score reading, regimens, traditions and Force Alchemy. Force V2 was merged at the audited commit and is offline-validated only; the Foundry v13 acceptance matrix (24 rows) is unexecuted. The normal Force Point balance has a single, guarded writer and lifecycle hooks in force-power-hooks are correctly gated. Real problems: the bonus Force Point pool has six builders and two flag scopes; the Force Point maximum is computed by two formulas and the dailyForcePoints house rule never reaches the stored max; Dark Side Score has no mutation owner; Force Alchemy moves credits outside TransactionEngine; force-suite-runtime-repairs patches the executor and DerivedCalculator at runtime; ForceExecutor also hosts ~15 talent actions and an ungated deleteCombat cleanup.",
